---
// Under-resourced innovators — Crystal's startup. The map beside the
// introduction her assistant actually makes (founder 2026-08-05).
import PhoneFrame from './PhoneFrame.astro';
import AppIcon from './AppIcon.astro';
import ScenePair from './ScenePair.astro';
---
<ScenePair eyebrow="Under-resourced innovators · Crystal's startup">
  <img slot="image" src="/img/2026/01/crystal-home.jpg" alt="A founder working at her kitchen counter while holding her toddler." loading="lazy" />
  <svg slot="map" viewBox="0 0 340 250" role="img"
    aria-label="A map route: Crystal, an under-resourced founder; her AI assistant reads the roadblock; a peer founder holds the missing half; together they launch a shared venture — plan drafted by the assistant, seeded by the commons.">
    <path d="M-10,108 q45,-12 90,0 t90,0 t90,0 t90,0" fill="none" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="0.9" opacity="0.5" />
    <path d="M-10,178 q45,10 90,0 t90,0 t90,0 t90,0" fill="none" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="0.9" opacity="0.4" />
    <path d="M44,48 C92,20 148,36 200,64 C226,88 152,112 110,140 C78,162 190,168 256,204"
      fill="none" stroke="var(--peach)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 6" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <circle cx="44" cy="48" r="16" fill="var(--bone-warm)" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="1.2" />
    <text x="44" y="53" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">💡</text>
    <text x="46" y="82" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)" text-anchor="middle">Crystal</text>
    <text x="46" y="94" font-size="9" font-style="italic" fill="var(--ink-soft)" text-anchor="middle">a founder, under-resourced</text>
    <circle cx="200" cy="64" r="16" fill="var(--peach-tint)" stroke="var(--peach)" stroke-width="1.2" />
    <g transform="translate(191,55)" color="var(--peach-deep)">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
        <path d="M9.5 3.5a3 3 0 00-3 3v.6a3 3 0 00-2.5 2.95V12a3 3 0 002.5 2.95v.6a3 3 0 003 3h2.5V3.5H9.5z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M14.5 3.5a3 3 0 013 3v.6a3 3 0 012.5 2.95V12a3 3 0 01-2.5 2.95v.6a3 3 0 01-3 3H12V3.5h2.5z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M9.5 8h-1M9.5 11.5h-1M14.5 8h1M14.5 11.5h1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
    </g>
    <text x="222" y="60" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)" text-anchor="start">her assistant</text>
    <text x="222" y="72" font-size="9" font-style="italic" fill="var(--ink-soft)" text-anchor="start">reads the roadblock</text>
    <circle cx="110" cy="140" r="16" fill="var(--bone-warm)" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="1.2" />
    <text x="110" y="145" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">🔧</text>
    <text x="88" y="136" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)" text-anchor="end">a peer founder</text>
    <text x="88" y="148" font-size="9" font-style="italic" fill="var(--ink-soft)" text-anchor="end">the missing half</text>
    <circle cx="256" cy="204" r="16" fill="var(--bone-warm)" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="1.2" />
    <text x="256" y="209" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">🚀</text>
    <text x="250" y="236" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)" text-anchor="middle">a shared venture</text>
    <text x="250" y="248" font-size="9" font-style="italic" fill="var(--ink-soft)" text-anchor="middle">plan drafted · seeded by the commons</text>
  </svg>

  <PhoneFrame slot="phone" initial="C" active="home" mark={false}>
    <div class="cry">
      <div class="cry-ai">
        <span class="cry-ai-avatar">
          <AppIcon name="brain" size={22} />
          <span class="cry-ai-el">Si</span>
        </span>
        <p class="cry-ai-name">AI Assistant</p>
        <p class="cry-ai-scope">Your Lichen Partner</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cry-card cry-card--match">
        <p><strong>Your roadblock is <span class="cry-ref">Devon Marsh</span>&rsquo;s strength</strong> — he&rsquo;s solved supply-chain twice, and he&rsquo;s stuck exactly where you&rsquo;re strong.</p>
        <span class="cry-chip">Introduce us &rarr;</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cry-card">
        <p><strong>Both of you are in <span class="cry-ref">Founders in Residence</span></strong> — the shared room already exists. I drafted a first plan you can both edit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cry-card">
        <p><strong>After what you can build together</strong>, one gap is left: $4,200 of lab time. That&rsquo;s the piece the commons can seed.</p>
        <span class="cry-chip">Ask the commons &rarr;</span>
      </div>
      <p class="cry-foot">Carbon decides; silicon organizes.</p>
    </div>
  </PhoneFrame>

  <Fragment slot="capmap">
    Innovation today runs on exclusivity — guard the idea, outrun the rest. Radical
    collaboration is the more efficient engine: shared knowledge compounds instead of
    duplicating effort.
  </Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="capphone">
    Her assistant reads what each founder is missing, makes the introduction, and drafts
    the plan — then the platform resources only what they still can&rsquo;t contribute
    together. The commons seeds what the old economy starved.
  </Fragment>
</ScenePair>

<style>
  .cry { padding: 10px 12px 12px; }
  .cry-ai { text-align: center; padding-bottom: 8px; }
  .cry-ai-avatar {
    position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--sky); color: var(--sky);
  }
  .cry-ai-el {
    position: absolute; top: -2px; right: -4px;
    min-width: 14px; height: 14px; padding: 0 3px; border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--sky); color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 6.5px; font-weight: 600;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .cry-ai-name { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 5px; }
  .cry-ai-scope {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--sky); margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .cry-card {
    background: var(--bone-warm); border: 1px solid var(--bone-edge); border-radius: var(--r-md);
    padding: 8px 10px; margin-bottom: 7px;
  }
  .cry-card p { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .cry-card p strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .cry-card--match { border-color: var(--sky); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sky) 12%, transparent); }
  .cry-ref {
    color: var(--sky); font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sky) 45%, transparent);
  }
  .cry-chip {
    display: inline-block; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sky); border: 1px solid var(--sky); border-radius: var(--r-full);
    padding: 2px 8px;
  }
  .cry-foot {
    text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-display); font-style: italic;
    font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: 8px;
  }
</style>
